          "description": "Dedupe is a python library for fuzzy matching, deduplication and entity resolution on structured data. The library makes use of active learning to match record pairs. Active learning is useful in cases without training data. Dedupe has a side-product for deduplicating CSV files, csvdedupe, through the command line. Dedupeio also offers commercial products for data matching.",
